order-white/10 hover:border-ink-400 dark:hover:border-white/20 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors\">Get started</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card rounded-2xl p-8 ring-1 ring-mint-500/40 shadow-glow relative\">\n        <span class=\"absolute top-0 right-6 -translate-y-1/2 pill text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Most popular</span>\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Pro</h3>\n        <div class=\"mt-4 num text-4xl font-bold\">$19<span class=\"text-base font-medium text-ink-500 dark:text-ink-400\">/mo</span></div>\n        <p class=\"text-ink-500 dark:text-ink-400 text-sm mt-1\">+ 0.3% per received payment</p>\n        <ul class=\"mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-ink-700 dark:text-ink-300\">\n          <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-mint-600 dark:text-mint-400\">✓</span> Everything in Free</li>\n          <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-mint-600 dark:text-mint-400\">✓</span> Unlimited invoices &amp; recurring</li>\n          <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-mint-600 dark:text-mint-400\">✓</span> Multi-wallet, payroll, batch send</li>\n          <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-mint-600 dark:text-mint-400\">✓</span> Webhooks &amp; API access</li>\n          <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-mint-600 dark:text-mint-400\">✓</span> Priority support</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#cta\" class=\"mt-8 block text-center w-full bg-mint-600 hover:bg-mint-700 dark:bg-mint-500 dark:hover:bg-mint-400 text-white dark:text-ink-950 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold transition-colors\">Start free trial</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card rounded-2xl p-8\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Enterprise</h3>\n        <div class=\"mt-4 text-4xl font-bold\">Custom</div>\n        <p class=\"text-ink-500 dark:text-ink-400 text-sm mt-1\">For agencies &amp; platforms</p>\n        <ul class=\"mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-ink-700 dark:text-ink-300\">\n          <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-mint-600 dark:text-mint-400\">✓</span> Custom rates from 0.1%</li>\n          <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-mint-600 dark:text-mint-400\">✓</span> SLA &amp; SOC2 packet</li>\n          <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-mint-600 dark:text-mint-400\">✓</span> Dedicated infra</li>\n          <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-mint-600 dark:text-mint-400\">✓</span> Sub-account orchestration</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"mailto:hi@paya.fund\" class=\"mt-8 block text-center w-full border border-ink-200 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-ink-400 dark:hover:border-white/20 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors\">Contact sales</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ── DEVELOPERS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->\n<section id=\"devs\" class=\"py-20 sm:py-28\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\">\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"text-mint-600 dark:text-mint-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">Developers</p>\n      <h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-balance\">A clean REST API. SDKs for the rest of you.</h2>\n      <p class=\"mt-6 text-lg text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300 leading-relaxed\">82 endpoints, JWT auth, idempotency keys, signed webhooks. Build payouts into your platform in an afternoon.</p>\n      <div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4\">\n        <a href=\"/docs\" class=\"border border-ink-200 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-ink-400 dark:hover:border-white/20 px-5 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors\">API docs →</a>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/paya-fund\" class=\"border border-ink-200 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-ink-400 dark:hover:border-white/20 px-5 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors\">GitHub</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card rounded-2xl p-6 font-mono text-sm bg-ink-900 dark:bg-ink-900/60 text-ink-100\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\">\n        <span class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500/60\"></span>\n        <span class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/60\"></span>\n        <span class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500/60\"></span>\n        <span class=\"ml-3 text-xs text-ink-500\">create-payment-link.sh</span>\n      </div>\n<pre class=\"text-ink-200 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto\"><span class=\"text-ink-500\">$</span> curl <span class=\"text-mint-400\">https://paya.fund/api/v1/payment-links</span> \\\n    -H <span class=\"text-mint-400\">\"Authorization: Bearer $PAYA_TOKEN\"</span> \\\n    -H <span class=\"text-mint-400\">\"Content-Type: application/json\"</span> \\\n    -d '{\n      <span class=\"text-mint-400\">\"amount_usdc\"</span>: <span class=\"text-yellow-300\">120.00</span>,\n      <span class=\"text-mint-400\">\"description\"</span>: <span class=\"text-mint-400\">\"October retainer\"</span>,\n      <span class=\"text-mint-400\">\"expires_in_days\"</span>: <span class=\"text-yellow-300\">7</span>\n    }'\n\n<span class=\"text-ink-500\">→</span> {\n    <span class=\"text-mint-400\">\"slug\"</span>: <span class=\"text-mint-400\">\"r9k2-fp7n\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"text-mint-400\">\"url\"</span>: <span class=\"text-mint-400\">\"https://paya.fund/pay/r9k2-fp7n\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"text-mint-400\">\"status\"</span>: <span class=\"text-mint-400\">\"active\"</span>\n  }</pre>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ── CTA ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->\n<section id=\"cta\" class=\"py-20 sm:py-28 bg-gradient-to-b from-ink-50 to-white dark:from-ink-900/40 dark:to-ink-950 border-t border-ink-200 dark:border-white/5\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 text-center\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-balance\">Ready to get paid?</h2>\n    <p class=\"mt-6 text-lg text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300\">No card needed. Free forever for individuals.</p>\n    <a href=\"/register\" class=\"mt-10 inline-block bg-mint-600 hover:bg-mint-700 dark:bg-mint-500 dark:hover:bg-mint-400 text-white dark:text-ink-950 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg transition-colors\">\n      Create your account\n    </a>\n    <p class=\"mt-6 text-xs text-ink-500 dark:text-ink-500\">By signing up you agree to the <a href=\"/terms\" class=\"underline hover:text-ink-700 dark:hover:text-ink-300\">Terms</a> and <a href=\"/privacy\" class=\"underline hover:text-ink-700 dark:hover:text-ink-300\">Privacy</a>.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ── FOOTER ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->\n<footer class=\"border-t border-ink-200 dark:border-white/5 py-12\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-sm\">\n    <div>\n      <a href=\"/\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-base\">\n        <span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-mint-500/15 text-mint-600 dark:text-mint-400 border border-mint-500/30\">P</span>\n        <span>Paya</span>\n      </a>\n      <p class=\"mt-4 text-ink-500 dark:text-ink-500\">Stablecoin payments for freelancers and small businesses. Built on Solana.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"font-semibold text-ink-700 dark:text-ink-200\">Product</p>\n      <ul class=\"mt-3 space-y-2 text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-400\">\n        <li><a href=\"#features\" class=\"hover:text-ink-900 dark:hover:text-white\">Features</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#pricing\" class=\"hover:text-ink-900 dark:hover:text-white\">Pricing</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#download\" class=\"hover:text-ink-900 dark:hover:text-white\">Mobile app</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"font-semibold text-ink-700 dark:text-ink-200\">Developers</p>\n      <ul class=\"mt-3 space-y-2 text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-400\">\n        <li><a href=\"/docs\" class=\"hover:text-ink-900 dark:hover:text-white\">API docs</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://github.com/paya-fund\" class=\"hover:text-ink-900 dark:hover:text-white\">GitHub</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/changelog\" class=\"hover:text-ink-900 dark:hover:text-white\">Changelog</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"font-semibold text-ink-700 dark:text-ink-200\">Company</p>\n      <ul class=\"mt-3 space-y-2 text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-400\">\n        <li><a href=\"/terms\" class=\"hover:text-ink-900 dark:hover:text-white\">Terms</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/privacy\" class=\"hover:text-ink-900 dark:hover:text-white\">Privacy</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"mailto:hi@paya.fund\" class=\"hover:text-ink-900 dark:hover:text-white\">Contact</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 mt-10 pt-8 border-t border-ink-200 dark:border-white/5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-ink-500 dark:text-ink-500\">\n    <span>© 2026 Paya. All rights reserved.</span>\n    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-mint-500 dark:bg-mint-400\"></span>\n      All systems operational\n    </span>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n<script>\n  // Theme toggle: persist user choice; sync browser theme-color too.\n  (function() {\n    var btn = document.getElementById('theme-toggle');\n    if (!btn) return;\n    function setTheme(t) {\n      document.documentElement.classList.toggle('dark', t === 'dark');\n      try { localStorage.setItem('paya-theme', t); } catch (e) {}\n    }\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function() {\n      var nowDark = document.documentElement.classList.contains('dark');\n      setTheme(nowDark ? 'light' : 'dark');\n    });\n    // Follow system if user hasn't chosen yet\n    var mq = matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)');\n    mq.addEventListener && mq.addEventListener('change', function(e) {\n      if (!localStorage.getItem('paya-theme')) {\n        setTheme(e.matches ? 'dark' : 'light');\n      }\n    });\n  })();\n</script>\n\n\n\n</body></html>",
